[thin] Accepted wing fit: each reading is one of the bezel's two horizontal wings, 1.44 mm thick, projecting 3.60 mm and spanning 70 mm, the wing of the accepted face-up bezel (face-up-trial/physical-acceptance.json), which prints with its back and both wings on the bed.
alternatives: A thicker wing needs a deeper pocket in front-top or a thinner retaining lip, each a change to the accepted fit.
